  "post_content": "<p>La asociaci&oacute;n fotogr&aacute;fica de Onda L&#39;Art de la Llum&nbsp;celebra hoy en la Plaza de Espa&ntilde;a su tradicional D&iacute;a de la Foto. A lo largo de la ma&ntilde;ana las personas que lo han deseado han posado&nbsp;para los miembros de la asociaci&oacute;n en el estudio que se ha montado.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2011/12/IMG_3942.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La actividad se complementaba con una exposici&oacute;n de siete fotograf&iacute;as gigantes sobre ojos de Pascual Bort Cubero, colgadas en los &aacute;rboles. Esta tarde las personas que hayan sido fotografiadas podr&aacute;n recoger las im&aacute;genes expuestas.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelafoto/img_3938.jpg\" alt=\"img_3938\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelafoto/img_3939.jpg\" alt=\"img_3939\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelafoto/img_3940.jpg\" alt=\"img_3940\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelafoto/img_3941.jpg\" alt=\"img_3941\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelafoto/img_3942.jpg\" alt=\"img_3942\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelafoto/img_3943.jpg\" alt=\"img_3943\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelafoto/img_3944.jpg\" alt=\"img_3944\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelafoto/img_3945.jpg\" alt=\"img_3945\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelafoto/img_3946.jpg\" alt=\"img_3946\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelafoto/img_3947.jpg\" alt=\"img_3947\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelafoto/img_3948.jpg\" alt=\"img_3948\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelafoto/img_3949.jpg\" alt=\"img_3949\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelafoto/img_3950.jpg\" alt=\"img_3950\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelafoto/img_3954.jpg\" alt=\"img_3954\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelafoto/img_3955.jpg\" alt=\"img_3955\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelafoto/img_3956.jpg\" alt=\"img_3956\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diadelafoto/artllumalcalde.jpg\" alt=\"artllumalcalde\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
